.TH PMCT 1 "July 2026" "Zeus Engineering Platform"
.SH NAME
pmct \- Progressive Manual Capability Test interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pmct
[\-\-help] {inspect,list,show,run,report}
.SH DESCRIPTION
Executes and inspects evidence-producing Operational Alpha capability tests.
.SH QUALIFICATION MODEL
Sealed PMCT PASS evidence remains distinct from verification and acceptance.
.SH GATES
Exactly one OA-NN gate is selected for a run.
.SH COMMANDS
run, inspect, report, list, and show.
.SH REPORTS
Reports may select an exact completed run identifier.
.SH EVIDENCE
Runs contain results, reports, manifests, hashes, and a COMPLETE marker.
.SH FILES
.I engineering/runtime/pmct/runs
and
.I engineering/runtime/pmct/capability-state.yaml
.SH EXAMPLES
.B pmct run OA-01
.br
.B pmct help inspect
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 successful command or PASS run; nonzero for invalid invocation or non-PASS result.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zeus (1)
